{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ab8f8109-2440-4d5e-9f64-f8399374e0e1",
    "name": "CCS - Config Alertas (Portal)",
    "description": "Pruebas del portal CCS: obtener token de Cognito, y consumir el endpoint Config Alertas (GET/PUT) protegido con JWT en API Gateway.\n\nPASOS:\n1) Edita las variables de la coleccion (boton derecho > Edit > Variables): pon el 'baseUrl' con el output api_endpoint de Terraform, y confirma cognitoClientId, username y password.\n2) Ejecuta '1. Obtener token' -> guarda el IdToken automaticamente.\n3) Ejecuta '2. PUT config' y '3. GET config'.\n4) '4. GET sin token' debe devolver 401 (demuestra que Cognito protege la API).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "16049342"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Obtener token (Cognito)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "let json;",
              "try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { json = {}; }",
              "if (json.AuthenticationResult && json.AuthenticationResult.IdToken) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('idToken', json.AuthenticationResult.IdToken);",
              "  console.log('IdToken guardado en la variable {{idToken}}');",
              "  pm.test('Token obtenido', function () { pm.expect(json.AuthenticationResult.IdToken).to.be.a('string'); });",
              "} else {",
              "  console.log('No se obtuvo IdToken. Respuesta:', pm.response.text());",
              "  pm.test('Token obtenido', function () { pm.expect.fail('Sin IdToken: ' + pm.response.text()); });",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-amz-json-1.1"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-Amz-Target",
            "value": "AWSCognitoIdentityProviderService.InitiateAuth"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"AuthFlow\": \"USER_PASSWORD_AUTH\",\n  \"ClientId\": \"{{cognitoClientId}}\",\n  \"AuthParameters\": {\n    \"USERNAME\": \"{{username}}\",\n    \"PASSWORD\": \"{{password}}\"\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://cognito-idp.{{region}}.amazonaws.com/",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "cognito-idp",
            "{{region}}",
            "amazonaws",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            ""
          ]
        },
        "description": "Llama a la API InitiateAuth de Cognito (flujo USER_PASSWORD_AUTH, no requiere firma AWS). El script de Test guarda el IdToken en la variable {{idToken}}."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. PUT config (guardar)",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{idToken}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cliente@correo.com\",\n  \"telefono\": \"+573001234567\",\n  \"alertasHabilitadas\": [\"panico\", \"accidente\", \"temperatura\"]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}config/{{clienteId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}config"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{clienteId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Crea/actualiza la configuracion de alertas del cliente {{clienteId}}. Requiere el header Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. GET config (leer)",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{idToken}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}config/{{clienteId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}config"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{clienteId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Devuelve la configuracion guardada del cliente {{clienteId}}."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4. GET sin token (debe dar 401)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Devuelve 401 sin token', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(401); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}config/{{clienteId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}config"
          ],
          "path": [
            "{{clienteId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Prueba de seguridad: sin el token, API Gateway rechaza la peticion con 401. Demuestra que el autorizador de Cognito funciona."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://TU-API-ID.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/"
    },
    {
      "key": "region",
      "value": "us-east-1"
    },
    {
      "key": "cognitoClientId",
      "value": "2ij92aeedqulq7ri1f7eh6auk0"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "jhonarcila_test@ccs.local"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "CcsTest2026!"
    },
    {
      "key": "clienteId",
      "value": "cli-001"
    },
    {
      "key": "idToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}